          <div class="hero-grid">
            <div class="banner" id="banner">
              <div class="slide s1 on"><div class="tag">WELCOME OFFER</div><h2>PLAY-MONEY SANDBOX</h2><p>Every game runs on a real house edge, so spend your bankroll wisely. Extra funds are only available in admin mode.</p><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="Nav.go('promos')">Promotions</button><div class="art">🎁</div></div>
              <div class="slide s2"><div class="tag">CUP ORIGINAL</div><h2>CRASH &amp; AVIATOR</h2><p>Cash out before the plane flies away. Auto cash-out, live bets and a 97% RTP in Aviator.</p><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="Games.open('aviator')">Play Aviator</button><div class="art">✈️</div></div>
              <div class="slide s3"><div class="tag">INSTANT WINS</div><h2>MINES · PLINKO · KENO</h2><p>Stake-style originals with 1% house edge, adjustable risk and auto-bet.</p><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="Nav.go('home','originals')">Browse originals</button><div class="art">💎</div></div>
              <div class="slide s4"><div class="tag">SPORTSBOOK</div><h2>LIVE ODDS</h2><p>Singles and accumulators with a realistic bookmaker margin built into the odds.</p><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="Nav.go('sports','soccer')">Open sportsbook</button><div class="art">⚽</div></div>
              <div class="dots" id="dots"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-side">
              <div class="hstat"><div class="hstat-lbl">Wagered</div><div class="hstat-val" id="tot-wagered">$0.00</div></div>
              <div class="hstat"><div class="hstat-lbl">Won</div><div class="hstat-val" id="tot-won">$0.00</div></div>
              <div class="hstat"><div class="hstat-lbl">Net P&amp;L</div><div class="hstat-val" id="net-pnl">$0.00</div></div>
              <div class="jackpot"><div class="jl">SANDBOX JACKPOT</div><div class="jv" id="jackpot">$1,284,930</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
