        </div>
        <div class="site-foot"><b>Cup Casino</b> is a private play-money sandbox for reference and testing. No real money, no real prizes, never published. Every game uses a cryptographic RNG and a genuine house edge: Originals 99% RTP, slots ≈96%, tables at their standard rules.</div>
